DEFINITIONS

"Work" means the software, research, documentation, data, experimental results,
theoretical frameworks, and any other materials contained in this repository,
including but not limited to the Informational Substrate Convergence (ISC) theory,
the Second-Order Relational Coherence (SORC) metric, and all associated
experimental findings.

"Non-Commercial Use" means use for academic research, education, personal
study, or non-profit purposes where no direct or indirect financial benefit,
revenue, or commercial advantage is derived from the Work or any derivative.

"Commercial Use" means any use of the Work, in whole or in part, in a product
or service that is sold, licensed, subscribed to, or otherwise monetised; any
use in a commercial research context where the results or derivatives are
used to develop, improve, or inform a commercial product or service; any use
by a for-profit entity where the Work contributes to that entity's commercial
objectives, directly or indirectly.

